{
  "duration": 93.219,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.1,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.62,
      "end": 2.819,
      "text": "It's time to solve"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.439,
      "end": 4.319,
      "text": "one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.839,
      "end": 5.559,
      "text": "In this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.179,
      "end": 6.979,
      "text": "we are given that"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.559,
      "end": 9.239,
      "text": "sine theta plus cos theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.76,
      "end": 11.34,
      "text": "is equal to seven by five,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.759,
      "end": 14.42,
      "text": "and we need to find sine theta into cos theta."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.979,
      "end": 17.819,
      "text": "Whenever we see sine theta plus cos theta together,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.319,
      "end": 20.18,
      "text": "there is one very useful trick."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.579,
      "end": 21.799,
      "text": "We square both sides."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.719,
      "end": 24.399,
      "text": "So sine theta plus cos theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.779,
      "end": 27.399,
      "text": "whole square is equal to seven by five whole square."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.019,
      "end": 29.199,
      "text": "After opening the bracket,"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.539,
      "end": 31.199,
      "text": "this becomes sine square theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.639,
      "end": 33.639,
      "text": "plus cos square theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.139,
      "end": 35.239,
      "text": "plus two"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.799,
      "end": 37.759,
      "text": "sine theta cos theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.159,
      "end": 39.2,
      "text": "is equal to forty-nine"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.7,
      "end": 43.7,
      "text": "by twenty-five. Now, as we know, the standard identity sine square theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.059,
      "end": 45.539,
      "text": "plus cos square theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 47.239,
      "text": "is always equal to one,"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.739,
      "end": 49.099,
      "text": "and it works for every angle."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.539,
      "end": 56.039,
      "text": "So we replace sine square theta plus cos square theta with one."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.559,
      "end": 66.379,
      "text": "Now, the equation becomes one plus two sine theta cos theta is equal to forty-nine by twenty-five. The question is asking for sine theta cos theta."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.76,
      "end": 68.559,
      "text": "So we need to isolate that term."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.139,
      "end": 70.879,
      "text": "Subtracting one from both sides,"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.18,
      "end": 78.5,
      "text": "we get two sine theta cos theta is equal to twenty-four by twenty-five. Now divide both sides by two."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.959,
      "end": 87.379,
      "text": "We get sine theta cos theta is equal to twelve by twenty-five. Done and dusted."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.08,
      "end": 91.139,
      "text": "So the final answer will be twelve by twenty-five. Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.68,
      "end": 93.219,
      "text": "option D is the correct answer"
    }
  ],
